  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Marketing/Storage/Processing: Food System Resilience Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall regional programme aims at strengthening food systems risk management, improving the sustainability and adaptive capacity of the productive base of food systems and facilitating food market integration in the region. The development objective is to increase preparedness against food insecurity and increase the resilience of food systems in Senegal.</narrative>
